---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Glitched Network privacy policy.">
    <main class="legal-page">
        <article>
            <h1 class="font-PressStart2P">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>Short version: we only use the information we need to run the server, moderate it, and keep things from breaking.</p>

            <h2>What We May See</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Your Minecraft username, UUID, joins, chat, claims, economy activity, punishments, and other normal server logs.</li>
                <li>Your Discord name, tickets, reports, and messages if you talk with us there.</li>
                <li>Basic website logs from hosting, like page visits, browser info, IP address, and errors.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Why We Use It</h2>
            <p>We use this stuff to run Glitched SMP, help players, handle reports, stop griefing or cheating, fix bugs, and improve the server.</p>

            <h2>Who Else Handles It</h2>
            <p>Some services we use may process data too, like Discord, GitHub Pages, hosting providers, and Minecraft status or skin APIs. We do not control their privacy policies.</p>

            <h2>Asking About Your Data</h2>
            <p>If you want something corrected or removed, ask staff in the Discord. We may keep records that are needed for moderation, safety, backups, or proof of what happened.</p>
        </article>
    </main>
</MainLayout>
